SCOPE — WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS
================================================================================

This is a summary of scope, not part of the license text.

COVERED. The original source code of this project, namely:

  src/          the sync pipeline, Discord bot, Hono server, and infographics
  web/src/      the React web application
  scripts/      build and verification tooling
  drizzle/      database schema and migrations
  the repository's own configuration, documentation, and build files

NOT COVERED. This project mirrors and aggregates third-party material. The
licensor holds no copyright in it and grants no license to it. It is excluded
from the grant below, and your use of it is governed by its own terms and by
the rights of its owners:

  web/public/game-assets/    Game art (portraits, weapon art, skill, summon and
                             key icons) belonging to Sunborn Network Technology,
                             mirrored into this repository for use by this fan
                             project.

  web/public/gfl2-icons/     UI icons (class, phase, ammo, Imago factor) from
                             IOP Wiki (https://iopwiki.com/wiki), used under
                             CC BY-SA 3.0. See THIRD-PARTY NOTICES below.

  data/                      Game data compiled from the game itself and from
                             community sources, including the community-
                             maintained "GFL2 Official Release Info
                             Compilation" spreadsheet.

  web/public/blablalink.png  Third-party mark.

"Girls' Frontline 2: Exilium" and related names, marks, and imagery are the
property of their respective owners. This project is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by Sunborn Network Technology, Discord Inc., or any
third-party data source. No trademark license is granted.

Removing the game assets and data does not affect your license to the code.

NO RESTRICTION ASSERTED OVER THE COMPILATION. The licensor does not own the
game content in data/ or web/public/game-assets/ and cannot license it. Over
the compilation itself — the extraction and organization of that material — the
licensor asserts no restriction: copy those files and use them in any fan
project, with no permission request and no attribution condition. Serve your own
copy rather than requesting assets from refittingroom.app, whose paths are
rewritten on every content sync. Excluded, per the notices above:
data/recommendations-source.json (compilation spreadsheet, used by permission
granted to this project only) and web/public/gfl2-icons/ (CC BY-SA 3.0).


